==Mechanics==
The meat tree's health is five times the total [[Woodcutting]] level of the party, having a minimum of 100 health.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1050389144260743169|date=11 October 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/107554|archivedate=30 May 2020|quote=[Meat tree health is] 5 x the team's total Woodcutting levels, or 100, whichever is greater.}} For example, if a party of three has level 35, 73 and 99 Woodcutting, the tree's health would be 1,035; and in a party of three where each player has 50 woodcutting, the tree's health would be 750. 

The chance of successfully dealing "damage" to the tree scales with the player's Woodcutting level, being 20% at level 1 and 78% at level 99, while the "damage" is based on the player's current Woodcutting level divided by two and between -7/+3 of that result; e.g a player with 80 Woodcutting would deal anywhere from 33-43 damage<ref>{{PlainCiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1789930221224804569|date=13 May 2024}}</ref>. The type of [[axe]] used has no impact.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1072850074408022017|date=12 December 2018|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/109126|archivedate=30 May 2020|quote=I see no reference to the axe type in the code other than to make the correct model appear in your hand as you perform the animation.}}

